  The unmodified x86-64 encoder kernels and NASM includes come from the same
  libjpeg-turbo 2.1.5.1 tag. Their source files retain the zlib notices.

On Windows x64, NASM or YASM assembles the SSE2 compressor when available.
JPEG decoding and builds without those kernels use the scalar implementation.
src/native_symbols.h namespaces the library symbols. Cargo generates
configuration headers and public header copies in OUT_DIR. grainy-raw and
grainy-codecs link this single library through links = "grainy_jpeg".

cc (build dependency): MIT OR Apache-2.0.
grainy-testkit and ndarray are test-only workspace dependencies.
